  <section class="section" id="s2">
    <h2>2. The DPDP Act 2023 — Overview &amp; Context</h2>

    <p>The <strong>Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 (DPDP Act)</strong> is India's landmark law enacted on <em>August 11, 2023</em>, protecting the digital personal data of individuals. It received Presidential assent on August 11, 2023 and replaced the earlier, fragmented provisions under the Information Technology Act, 2000.</p>

